## 📖 About the Project

This repository was created to document my learning journey and continuous growth in **COBOL development for IBM Mainframe environments**.

Here, you will find practical examples, exercises, programs, and studies related to the Mainframe ecosystem used by major financial institutions and mission-critical enterprises.

The main goal is to demonstrate COBOL fundamentals, structured programming best practices, and the integration with technologies widely adopted in IBM Mainframe environments.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Learn COBOL through hands-on practice
- Develop programming logic for Mainframe environments
- Build applications following industry best practices
- Share knowledge with the community
- Build a professional Mainframe portfolio

---

## 🛠️ Technologies

- COBOL
- IBM z/OS
- TSO/ISPF
- JCL
- DB2
- VSAM
- CICS

---

# 📚 Topics Covered

## COBOL Fundamentals

- COBOL Program Structure
- IDENTIFICATION DIVISION
- ENVIRONMENT DIVISION
- DATA DIVISION
- PROCEDURE DIVISION
- Programming Best Practices

## Variables and Data Types

- PIC
- VALUE
- MOVE
- REDEFINES
- OCCURS
- Data Level Numbers (01, 05, 10, 77, 88)

## Arithmetic Operations and Business Calculations

- ADD
- SUBTRACT
- MULTIPLY
- DIVIDE
- COMPUTE
- Financial Calculations
- Percentage Calculations
- Running Totals
- Totals and Subtotals
- Rounding Operations

## Decision Structures

- IF / ELSE
- EVALUATE

## Loop Structures

- PERFORM
- PERFORM UNTIL
- PERFORM VARYING

## File Handling

- Sequential File Reading
- File Writing
- Record Updates
- Logical Record Deletion
- Input and Output Files
- File Organization
- EOF (End Of-File)
- FILE STATUS
- Sequential Files
- Indexed Files

## Balance Line Processing

- Balance Line between two files
- Merge of sorted files
- Record comparison
- New record insertion
- Existing record updates
- Record deletion
- Output file generation
- Exception and inconsistency handling

## Database

- Embedded SQL
- DB2
- Cursors
- SELECT
- INSERT
- UPDATE
- DELETE

## Batch Processing

- JCL
- Job Execution
- SORT
- IEBGENER
- IDCAMS
- Return Code (RC) Handling

## Mainframe Technologies

- IBM z/OS
- TSO/ISPF
- SDSF
- JES2
- VSAM
- CICS
